{"id":"paige-patterson","n":"Paige Patterson","photo":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/images/headshots/bio_paige_patterson.jpg","bio":"Dr. Paige Patterson, Th.M. and Ph.D. of theology , is considered one of the fathers of modern conservatism in the SBC and one of the most influential Southern Baptist leaders of the 20th century. He served seventeen years as President of Criswell College and eleven years as President of Southeastern Baptist Theological Seminary. He now serves as the eight President of Southwestern Baptist Theological Seminary in Ft. Worth, Texas. Paige and his wife Dorothy have 2 children and 2 grandchildren.","queue":["11575","11576","11577","29595","29596","29597","29598","29599","29600","29601","29602","29603","29604","29605","29606"],"talks":{"11575":{"t":"Biblical Inerrancy - Part 1 - The Christology of Inerrancy","sp":"paige-patterson","tp":["Inerrancy","Doctrine of Scripture"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/6184A.mp3","lk":0,"se":"Biblical Inerrancy","so":1,"pdf":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/PDFs/6184A.pdf"},"11576":{"t":"Biblical Inerrancy - Part 2 - Authority and Accuracy of the Bible","sp":"paige-patterson","tp":["Inerrancy","Doctrine of Scripture"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/6185A.mp3","lk":14,"se":"Biblical Inerrancy","so":2,"pdf":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/PDFs/6185A.pdf"},"11577":{"t":"Biblical Inerrancy - Part 3 - Introduction to Biblical Inerrancy","sp":"paige-patterson","tp":["Inerrancy","Doctrine of Scripture"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/6186A.mp3","lk":6,"se":"Biblical Inerrancy","so":3,"pdf":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/PDFs/6186A.pdf"},"29595":{"t":"Faithfulness In The Badlands","sp":"paige-patterson","tp":["Christ Our Life","Jesus Christ"],"u":"https://discipleshiplibrary.com/api/media/SWBTS011912.mp3","lk":1,"se":"The Shepherd King","so":1},"29596":{"t":"Never Take A Sword To A Rock Fight","sp":"paige-patterson","tp":["Christ Ou